Description:
Nordic Renew Resource AB is a Swedish Greentech startup and our revolutionary method to clean sludge from 85-95% of heavy metals will make our Earth a cleaner place! By taking out the heavy metals and recycling them, we leave our air, soil and water in a  much better condition than they where. What we are left with is clean solid and liquid fertilizers. 

It is time for us all to start to take our responsibility for the Earth. Not just take, but also, to give back! Money and profit can not be more important than the planet that we live on! So, if we work together, then maybe we can turn things around and make a change!
//Eva-Marie, Vice-VD Nordic Renew Resource AB
